praevis-thetadata
Copyright 2026 the praevis-thetadata contributors.

This project contains protocol definitions recovered from the ThetaData Python
distribution (originally version 1.0.12; currently version 1.0.17), published by
ThetaData under Apache License 2.0. The upstream license is preserved in
crates/praevis-thetadata-proto/LICENSE.upstream of the source repository and in
the praevis-thetadata-proto package. Source hashes and protocol provenance are
recorded in crates/praevis-thetadata-proto/schema/manifest.json and docs/research/
of https://github.com/Praevis-Quant/praevis-thetadata.

The Rust implementation, command-line application, documentation, and project
tooling are newly authored work. The protocol extraction and generated Rust
bindings are described in README.md; they are not the original Python sources.

Third-party dependencies retain their respective licenses. This project is not
an official ThetaData product and does not grant rights to ThetaData trademarks.
